             (++)  Table 1. HCLK clock frequency.
             (++)  +------------------------------------+
             (++)  | Latency         |  HCLK clock      |
             (++)  |                 |  frequency (MHz) |
             (++)  |                 |                  |
             (++)  |                 |-------------------
             (++)  |                 | voltage range 1  |
             (++)  |                 |   1.08V - 1.32V  |
             (++)  |-----------------|------------------|
             (++)  |0WS(1 CPU cycles)|      HCLK <= 24  |
             (++)  |-----------------|------------------|
             (++)  |1WS(2 CPU cycles)|      HCLK <= 48  |
             (++)  +------------------------------------+

  @endinternal
